{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X 在 S06、S07、S13 等处改写了人物的心理因果，尤其 S13 把“明知谁也没法答应永远”改成“就算听到保证仍担心时间”，改变了原本的动机，Y 在叙事准确性上更好。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 用“话/感受”分层和重点加亮，让观众能先抓住情节骨架，再随着音乐接收细腻感受；按音乐节点出现的感受，以及水波、船、漂浮到最后定锚的反复意象，也让前后形成了连贯的整体。Y 的完整叙述在人物心理因果上更可靠，但右侧短词相对缺少层次，X 则更容易让普通观众在听音乐的同时抓住重点，并获得具体、有变化的感官体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3577b590-125e-4ef8-99a3-d0c39f0a19ca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T230919634182Z", "elapsed_seconds": 71.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:10:31.331535+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c52d0ad233c558143408ebd702d03249070570264ee6719b360282cab362b614", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat